  "description": "Operational Hybrid-NMCC curriculum for State College with 3,000 individual evacuees. Exact common-noise action-versus-WAIT branches supervise an action-independent natural model and a candidate-local residual ensemble; recurrent PPO uses the paired causal advantage, a factorized critic, a delayed/fading robust-planner teacher, and a decaying exploration schedule. The fixed five-shelter-addition capacity budget is unchanged from every benchmark.",
